'''Muli Airport''' {{airport codes|MUM|VRKM}} is a domestic [[airport]] located on [[Muli (Meemu Atoll)|Muli]], one of the islands of the [[Meemu Atoll]] in [[Maldives]]. A test flight landed at Muli Airport on 25 April 2025.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Muli, Maldives {{!}} Maldivian|url=https://maldivian.aero/destinations/muli.html|access-date=2026-01-31|website=Flights to Muli (MUM)|language=en}}</ref> Maldives Transport and Contracting Company (MTCC) was contracted the [[Maldivian rufiyaa|MVR]] 540 million project to develop the airport terminal and fire building. 

== Airlines and destinations ==
The airport currently serves two commercial destinations.

